    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Mental Health Ambassadorship Program, initiated by the Brain and Mind Institute (BMI) at the Aga Khan University focuses on advancing mental health awareness and practices through a comprehensive Micro-Certificate course. The course aims to reduce stigma, nurture empathy, and provide early detection and recognition of mental illness. To increase open access, no prerequisites are required.",
